    \resumeItem{Scheduled sprint planning and used Jira/Jira Service Management (JSM) to track and manage Power BI dashboard/tool feature delivery, replacing the previous manual workflow with an automated approach the team adopted as the default pipeline.}
  \resumeItemListEnd

\resumeSubheading
  {Software Engineer Intern}{May 2023 -- December 2023}
  {Indian Institute of Technology, Indore}{Indore, India}
  \resumeItemListStart
    \resumeItem{Migrated AI/LLM patterns into analytics/dashboard work by applying AI exposure to customer experience use cases, improving model evaluation workflows, and after ablation runs cut runtime from about 40 to under 10.}
    \resumeItem{Reviewed with stakeholders across multiple teams, openly sharing knowledge, raising questions, taking initiative, and adapting priorities in a learn-as-you-go environment using Jira, Microsoft Teams, and R.}
    \resumeItem{Synced with business stakeholders to translate key questions into actionable insights, using Excel and PowerPoint alongside Power BI and/or JavaScript/React to drive decisions, which the team adopted as the default approach.}
